                           <q xml:lang="ar">Handwritten interlinear and marginal notes, vowel marks. Corrections marked ṣaḥḥ. Notes with markers: tā, ǧīm, ḥā, ḫā, šīn, ʻayn, qāf, kāf, yā, yāsīn, šarḥuhu, ḥāšiya, Qāmūs, al-Munīr, Ḥāšiyat al-imlā', Ḥāšiyat al-ǧurrūmiyya,  Taṣrīḥ, Tawḍīḥ, Šarḥ Mutammimat al-Aǧurrūmiyya, ʻAṭiyya al-aǧurrmiyya, Šayḫ al-islām, al-Siǧāʻī, ʻUbāda, Inbābī, Taqrīr Qarīrī, al-Nihāya. Notes with identified markers: Ḥāšiyat al-ʻAṭṭār, Tuḥfa, Tuḥfat al-ḥabīb, Ḥayāt al-ḥayawān (al-ǧuz' al-ṯānī), Mustaṭraf, Kawākib, Dasūqī ʻalā Umm al-barāhīn, Dasūqī ʻalā al-Muġnī, Fatḥ rabb al-bariyya, Fatḥ al-ǧawād, Muǧīb, Ṣabbān, Qalyūbī, Abū al-Naǧā, Ǧamal, Ušmūnī, Baǧīramī, Kurdī, Ḫuḍarī, Ibn ʻAqīl, Ḫālid, Damanhūr, Šanwānī.</q>
